  "label": "Auction House",
  "tagline": "A living player market: list, bid, buy out, order supplies and post want requests",
  "category": "Economy",
  "description": "Players list goods at auction houses around the map, bid or buy them out, and collect everything from a mailbox. A supply catalogue lets them order raw goods that arrive after a delivery time. A want-request board lets them post buy orders that other players fill.",
