      "label": "Live auctions",
      "tab": "auction",
      "export": "HubPanel",
      "itemLabel": "listing",
      "tooltip": "Every live auction, from all auction houses. Open a listing to see its bids and remove one. Cancel returns the item to the seller's mailbox and the leading bid to the bidder's mailbox, as when a seller cancels (the deposit is not returned). Extend adds hours to a listing that has not run out."
